<title>UK: W. Australian Tres Corp sets 12 billion yen bond.</title>
<headline>W. Australian Tres Corp sets 12 billion yen bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers IBJ International and New Japan Securities Limited.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTERN AUSTRALIAN TREASURY CORP</p>
<p> AMT    12 BLN YEN    COUPON     *6.05     MATURITY    08.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE   DUAL CURRENCY ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    08.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA    DENOMS (M) 500	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*REDEMPTION IN AUSTRALIAN DOLLARS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
